"roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144150","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"櫻川 めぐ","creatorId":"vndb:s553","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s553","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s553","name":"櫻川 めぐ","roleCode":"songs","roleLabel":"歌曲","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144151","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"ぴかいち","creatorId":"vndb:s14874","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14874","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14874","name":"ぴかいち","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144153","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"伊藤 直子","creatorId":"vndb:s14875","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s14875","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s14875","name":"伊藤 直子","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144154","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"つゑふ","creatorId":"vndb:s23462","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s23462","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s23462","name":"つゑふ","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144156","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"丸山 充弘","creatorId":"vndb:s26180","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s26180","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s26180","name":"丸山 充弘","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:144157","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c65107","characterName":"結城 彩楓","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226693"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18417"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65107"},"originalCharacterName":"結城 彩楓","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Not to toot my own horn, but I'd say I'm pretty good-looking.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Heroine Quirk: Fairy-tale ideas of romance"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The school idol, adored by all, and winner of the annual beauty pageant for two years running. She loves being in the spotlight, every action of hers driven by a desire to earn affection and admiration from others."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She secretly pours her all into improving herself, looking for a boyfriend who can live up to the same high standards that she holds herself to. Due to her bright and bombastic personality, people tend to think of her as something of a playgirl, but in truth, she's anything but."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ayaka has a naive, starry-eyed view of romantic relationships, and thus hates being seen as someone who engages in casual dating. Because of her innocence, however, her attempts to seduce Hajime often rebound and leave her feeling the most embarrassed."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65107"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"チヤホヤされることが大好きで、褒められたいという気持ちが彩楓を動かしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彩楓だからこそ、陰ながらの自分磨きには余念がなく、恋人なる男性にも自分と釣り合うだけのスペックを求めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく派手な性格からついつい遊んでいるように思われがちだが、むしろ真逆で本人はいたってピュア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性として軽く見られることには不快感を示すほどで、男女関係にはウブで良識的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公を誘惑しようとしては、逆に自分が恥ずかしさに耐えられなくなってテンパってしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18417","sourceWorkId":"25949","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ミスコン２連覇中、男女問わず圧倒的な人気を誇る学園のアイドル。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"チヤホヤされることが大好きで、褒められたいという気持ちが彩楓を動かしている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな彩楓だからこそ、陰ながらの自分磨きには余念がなく、恋人なる男性にも自分と釣り合うだけのスペックを求めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"明るく派手な性格からついつい遊んでいるように思われがちだが、むしろ真逆で本人はいたってピュア。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性として軽く見られることには不快感を示すほどで、男女関係にはウブで良識的。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公を誘惑しようとしては、逆に自分が恥ずかしさに耐えられなくなってテンパってしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59323"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/790673ea810adb2c0bf1327b5835a03a3c137d49d4eba7a67a5122b42965e5af.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/61/61d0afab980a55432c4145ff08ffede3b32678b79dc6e8309c8654e49bc9ce67.webp","width":139,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大橋歩夕","creatorId":"vndb:s1178","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1178","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1178","name":"大橋 歩夕","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226693:59323:6174:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65108","characterName":"小清水 香純","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59322","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226693"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18416"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65108"},"originalCharacterName":"小清水 香純","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Honestly, it makes me happy that you've developed an interest in my body.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Heroine Quirk: Pure, unabashed adoration"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A buxom beauty who knew Hajime many years ago, and transferred to this school in order to see him again. Kasumi's goal had been to confess her love to him all along—and that's exactly what she does, on the very day they reunite."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She boldly declares that she'll allow any of his desires, lavishing him with unconditional affection. Nevertheless, she refuses to make the first move, instead using sweet words to coax Hajime into taking the initiative."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to the straightforwardness of her approach, Hajime is constantly left to wonder if her feelings are genuine, or if she has some ulterior motive. Gentle and well-mannered, she carries with her a slight air of sophistication from her wealthy upbringing."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65108"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"その目的は主人公に告白するためであり、再会したその日に想いを打ち明けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の望むことならその全てを受け入れると言い、こちらにだけ無条件の好意を向けてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし香純から手を出すことはなく、とにかくこちらに手を出させようと甘い言葉で誘惑してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまりにも真っ直ぐに気持ちを向けられるため、それが純粋な好意なのか、裏に何かあるのか常に選択を迫られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温厚な性格で人当たりはいいが、実家がお金持ちらしくどこか世間ずれしたところがある。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18416","sourceWorkId":"25949","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃に面識があり、再び主人公と会うため編入してきたという美少女。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その目的は主人公に告白するためであり、再会したその日に想いを打ち明けられる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の望むことならその全てを受け入れると言い、こちらにだけ無条件の好意を向けてくれる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし香純から手を出すことはなく、とにかくこちらに手を出させようと甘い言葉で誘惑してくる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あまりにも真っ直ぐに気持ちを向けられるため、それが純粋な好意なのか、裏に何かあるのか常に選択を迫られる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"温厚な性格で人当たりはいいが、実家がお金持ちらしくどこか世間ずれしたところがある。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59322"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/21/215de414503ad5d3e383d5daa06423391b2c13ab601c0561d0c023b83f822477.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/deeb93be4f943648382d914b8a6ff85474aca0707420f1be7c5683d36a93a142.webp","width":134,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"尾崎真実","creatorId":"vndb:s199","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s199","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s199","name":"尾崎 真実","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226693:59322:8165:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65109","characterName":"花守 栞織","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59321","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226693"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18415"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65109"},"originalCharacterName":"花守 栞織","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"83"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"How about you turn down all those other girls and choose me instead?\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Heroine Quirk: Madly in love, single-minded devotion"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hajime's childhood friend, who has stuck by his side through thick and thin, and understands him better than anyone else."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She helped lift the ban on romantic relationships for personal reasons. A calm and modest girl of few words, Shiori is regarded by those around her as the perfect flower for her silent support of Hajime."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, the truth of the matter is that she has extreme social anxiety and gets easily tongue-tied around others. While she struggles to express herself with words, however, she is more than capable of demonstrating her emotions and resolve through action."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her forwardness often takes Hajime by surprise, making his heart skip a bit and bringing them closer to one another every time they talk. Happiest whenever she spends time together with him, Shiori always strives to do whatever it takes to be next to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65109"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"『恋愛解禁』においては自身の目的のために貢献した。落ち着いた性格に、控えめで口数も少なく、主人公を影で支える姿から周囲には大和撫子として一目置かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、実際には口下手で人前に出ることが苦手なだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口には出せないでいるが自分の意思ははっきり持っており、気持ちを行動で表現する。そのため大胆な行動に出ることが多く、主人公と話す時は必然的に距離感が近くなりドキッとさせられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と一緒の時間になによりも幸せを感じるため、常にそばにいて尽くしてくれる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18415","sourceWorkId":"25949","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の幼馴染であり、これまでどんな時もそばにいた一番の理解者。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"『恋愛解禁』においては自身の目的のために貢献した。落ち着いた性格に、控えめで口数も少なく、主人公を影で支える姿から周囲には大和撫子として一目置かれている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、実際には口下手で人前に出ることが苦手なだけ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"口には出せないでいるが自分の意思ははっきり持っており、気持ちを行動で表現する。そのため大胆な行動に出ることが多く、主人公と話す時は必然的に距離感が近くなりドキッとさせられてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公と一緒の時間になによりも幸せを感じるため、常にそばにいて尽くしてくれる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59321"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ec/ec6785fb79acb52fddf37c41aee88e71b04014f382e5d32e824e6a074940b4d2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/30377f175e416be2f228849c836143340d50ba92d3f384a91d46418004dadb58.webp","width":149,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"中島沙樹","creatorId":"vndb:s44","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s44","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s44","name":"中島 沙樹","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226693:59321:4500:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65110","characterName":"山吹 芳乃","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59325","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226693"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18419"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65110"},"originalCharacterName":"山吹 芳乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Just because I'm willing to give you my body d-does not mean you have my heart!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Heroine Quirk: Unable to fully mask her true self"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Straight-laced and always straight-faced, Yoshino is the student council vice president. Although exceedingly strict on herself, she is a kind girl at heart who finds it difficult to treat others with those same principles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As the representative of the anti-romance faction, she had run for student council president in opposition against Hajime, who had pledged to lift the ban on romantic relationships. However, the more she tries to deny her feelings for him, the stronger those feelings begin to grow—despite her adamant refusal to admit as such."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to her transparent personality, there's little doubt to anyone who knows her what her true feelings are. However, that simply adds to her charm. Yoshino is beloved and dependable as vice president, albeit somewhat of a stickler for the rules."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65110"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分には厳しい芳乃だが、他人にはなかなか厳しくできないとっても心の優しい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会選挙中は会長候補として、『恋愛解禁』を掲げる主人公と対立していた『恋愛否定派』代表。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公への恋心を必死に否定しようとするが、否定すればするほど意識してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし素直すぎるがゆえ、その好意は誰から見てもバレバレ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな愛嬌もあって、お固い雰囲気を漂わせていても、頼れる副会長としてみんなの愛されキャラになっている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18419","sourceWorkId":"25949","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"芯の通った素直な性格で、非常にストイックな生徒会の副会長。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分には厳しい芳乃だが、他人にはなかなか厳しくできないとっても心の優しい女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"生徒会選挙中は会長候補として、『恋愛解禁』を掲げる主人公と対立していた『恋愛否定派』代表。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため主人公への恋心を必死に否定しようとするが、否定すればするほど意識してしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし素直すぎるがゆえ、その好意は誰から見てもバレバレ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな愛嬌もあって、お固い雰囲気を漂わせていても、頼れる副会長としてみんなの愛されキャラになっている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59325"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/30/302449374ff3194912e3a63522cd4298368facc54a08100a4469ee7ae8758b5f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9ba7865dfd862686d80bb3a2103a2d38d7c94817d653424e812b5efd584b318e.webp","width":127,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"後藤麻衣","creatorId":"vndb:s469","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s469","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s469","name":"後藤 麻衣","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226693:59325:4809:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c65111","characterName":"古塚 由依","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"59324","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"226693"}],"egsCharacterIds":["18418"],"vndbCharacterId":"c65111"},"originalCharacterName":"古塚 由依","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"If you're content with me, I'll always be there for you if you need a helping hand.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Heroine Quirk: Both childlike and mature"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The charismatic student president of Kenseikan Academy's sister school, located on the same island. Yui is a sophisticated young lady who comes from a wealthy family with longstanding reputation and connections to the school."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is a curious girl who dislikes being passive, preferring to do things herself over relying on others. She takes pride in herself as a woman, and hates having her character judged by her appearance alone. For that reason, Yui always does her best to behave like the ideal mature woman in her mind—especially around Hajime."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite being a few years younger than him, her motherly disposition and high-mindedness often make her seem much older than she actually is. However, since she usually acts so grown-up, her rare expressions of childishness often make Hajime's heart skip a beat."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65111"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心が強く、じっとしているのが好きではないため他人に頼るより自分から行動を起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性としてのプライドが高いため、外見で人柄を判断されることを好ましく思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため由依自身が考える『オトナのいい女』であろうと常に心がけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に主人公に対しては、時折年下とは思えない母性にも似た包容力を感じさせ安心感を与えてくれる。そんな大人びた言動が板についた由依だからこそ、ふいに見せるあどけない表情にドキッとさせられる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"18418","sourceWorkId":"25949","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"同じ島内にある、兄弟校のカリスマ生徒会長。実家は古くからの街の名家で学園とも縁の深い生粋のお嬢様。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"好奇心が強く、じっとしているのが好きではないため他人に頼るより自分から行動を起こす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"女性としてのプライドが高いため、外見で人柄を判断されることを好ましく思っていない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため由依自身が考える『オトナのいい女』であろうと常に心がけている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特に主人公に対しては、時折年下とは思えない母性にも似た包容力を感じさせ安心感を与えてくれる。そんな大人びた言動が板についた由依だからこそ、ふいに見せるあどけない表情にドキッとさせられる。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"59324"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4d/4d72f4e0ca0b2a5e980edb79d756624cd6ac82703f4cf4c3903a600a212e3607.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/070c30ea169e209427d1be3007ddee08e4252289497b350c7577ab5ccbe7c8f9.webp","width":142,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎木実佳","creatorId":"vndb:s987","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s987","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s987","name":"榎木 実佳","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:226693:59324:10026:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65112","characterName":"二宮 肇","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65112"},"originalCharacterName":"二宮 肇","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"What I want is the freedom to experience all the things we can only experience now while we are young!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hajime is the hero of our story and the student council president who liberated the students of Kenseikan Academy from the school's century-long ban on romantic relationships."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While all sounds very impressive, though—the truth is, his revolution was born from two very simple wishes... to get a girlfriend, and enjoy his life while at Kenseikan Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In between laying the groundwork to convince the school board of this proposal, and rallying his peers around his cause, Hajime's unprecedented initiative and charisma captured the hearts of the student body and gained him widespread popularity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From NekoNyan"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65112"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/52/52c167eec572435f33f4efe26d3d8cfa6cc44e9214ddb499dc5ea3d652cc5fd4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f2/f2a0faa0b4841ad37ae535f75946de53a0700c99db53d18daf12d3412c63a4f3.webp","width":241,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c67285","characterName":"二宮 青葉","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c67285"},"originalCharacterName":"二宮 青葉","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"80"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"MC sister"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c67285"}],"